noPhotos

# higher D** D2S -> D* pi pi (ISGW2, PHSP), as the LHCb CocktailHigher
# LHCb-style cocktail component (DecFiles Sim10 11874430/12873450, 11676012/12675402), e/mu 50/50

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0  B+sig  B-sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B+sig
0.5  anti-D(2S)0  e+  nu_e   ISGW2;
0.5  anti-D(2S)0  mu+  nu_mu  ISGW2;
Enddecay
CDecay B-sig

Decay anti-D(2S)0
1.0  D*-  pi+  pi0   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay D(2S)0

End
